            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0145/ch0145_tactic_defeat_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "こうなると思ってました。私が関わると、結局いつもこんな風に…。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I thought it would be like this. When I'm involved, it always ends up like this"
